This product includes and displays data from the STALZONE item database:
https://github.com/EXBO-Studio/stalzone-database

The database is provided by EXBO Studio under the Apache License 2.0.
No EXBO database files are redistributed by this application; they are requested
from the public repository by the user's browser.

The application includes normalized artifact additional-property definitions
derived from the STALZONE Wiki calculator:
https://stalzone.wiki/builds-calculator

Regional rarity-specific price estimates are requested at runtime from the
STALZONE Market History project. They are historical completed-sale estimates,
not current listings or guarantees.
